 *
 * Core question: How many units are permitted per net new household,
 * and which metros sit furthest below replacement?
 *
 * Primary anchors: Census Building Permits Survey (BPS) annual finals;
 * Census Housing Vacancy Survey (HVS) household stock via FRED TTLHHM156N;
 * ACS 1-year occupied-housing-unit changes for metro formation (estimated
